{"suttaId":"tha-ap503","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[2879,2997],"vripara":"1"},"segments":{"tha-ap503:0.3":"Tikaṇikārapupphiyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap503:1.1":"“Sumedho nāma sambuddho, bāttiṃsavaralakkhaṇo;","tha-ap503:1.3":"Vivekakāmo sambuddho, himavantamupāgamiṃ.","tha-ap503:2.1":"“Ajjhogayha himavantaṃ, aggo kāruṇiko muni;","tha-ap503:2.3":"Pallaṅkamābhujitvāna, nisīdi purisuttamo.","tha-ap503:3.1":"“Vijjādharo tadā āsiṃ, antalikkhacaro ahaṃ;","tha-ap503:3.3":"Tisūlaṃ sukataṃ gayha, gacchāmi ambare tadā.","tha-ap503:4.1":"“Pabbatagge yathā aggi, puṇṇamāyeva candimā;","tha-ap503:4.3":"Vane obhāsate buddho, sālarājāva phullito.","tha-ap503:5.1":"“Vanaggā nikkhamitvāna, buddharaṃsībhidhāvare;","tha-ap503:5.3":"Naḷaggivaṇṇasaṅkāsā, disvā cittaṃ pasādayiṃ.","tha-ap503:6.1":"“Vicinaṃ addasaṃ pupphaṃ, kaṇikāraṃ devagandhikaṃ;","tha-ap503:6.3":"Tīṇi pupphāni ādāya, buddhaseṭṭhamapūjayiṃ.","tha-ap503:7.1":"“Buddhassa ānubhāvena, tīṇi pupphāni me tadā;","tha-ap503:7.3":"Uddhaṃvaṇṭā adhopattā, chāyaṃ kubbanti satthuno.","tha-ap503:8.1":"“Tena kammena sukatena, cetanāpaṇidhīhi ca;","tha-ap503:8.3":"Jahitvā mānusaṃ dehaṃ, tāvatiṃsamagacchahaṃ.","tha-ap503:9.1":"“Tattha me sukataṃ byamhaṃ, kaṇikārīti ñāyati;","tha-ap503:9.3":"Saṭṭhiyojanamubbedhaṃ, tiṃsayojanavitthataṃ.","tha-ap503:10.1":"“Sahassakaṇḍaṃ satabheṇḍu [satageṇḍu (syā.)], dhajāluharitāmayaṃ;","tha-ap503:10.3":"Satasahassaniyyūhā, byamhe pātubhaviṃsu me.","tha-ap503:11.1":"“Soṇṇamayā maṇimayā, lohitaṅgamayāpi ca;","tha-ap503:11.3":"Phalikāpi ca pallaṅkā, yenicchakā yadicchakā [yenicchayā yadicchakaṃ (syā.), yadicchakāyadicchakā (ka.)].","tha-ap503:12.1":"“Mahārahañca sayanaṃ, tūlikāvikatīyutaṃ;","tha-ap503:12.3":"Uddhalomikaekantaṃ, bimbohanasamāyutaṃ [bibbohanasamāyutaṃ …(syā. ka.)].","tha-ap503:13.1":"“Bhavanā nikkhamitvāna, caranto devacārikaṃ;","tha-ap503:13.3":"Yadā icchāmi gamanaṃ, devasaṅghapurakkhato.","tha-ap503:14.1":"“Pupphassa heṭṭhā tiṭṭhāmi, uparicchadanaṃ mama;","tha-ap503:14.3":"Samantā yojanasataṃ, kaṇikārehi chāditaṃ.","tha-ap503:15.1":"“Saṭṭhituriyasahassāni, sāyapātamupaṭṭhahuṃ;","tha-ap503:15.3":"Parivārenti maṃ niccaṃ, rattindivamatanditā.","tha-ap503:16.1":"“Tattha naccehi gītehi, tāḷehi vāditehi ca;","tha-ap503:16.3":"Ramāmi khiḍḍāratiyā, modāmi kāmakāmihaṃ.","tha-ap503:17.1":"“Tattha bhutvā pivitvā ca, modāmi tidase tadā;","tha-ap503:17.3":"Nārīgaṇehi sahito, modāmi byamhamuttame.","tha-ap503:18.1":"“Satānaṃ pañcakkhattuñca, devarajjamakārayiṃ;","tha-ap503:18.3":"Satānaṃ tīṇikkhattuñca, cakkavattī ahosahaṃ;","tha-ap503:18.5":"Padesarajjaṃ vipulaṃ, gaṇanāto asaṅkhiyaṃ.","tha-ap503:19.1":"“Bhavābhave saṃsaranto, mahābhogaṃ labhāmahaṃ;","tha-ap503:19.3":"Bhoge me ūnatā natthi, buddhapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap503:20.1":"“Duve bhave saṃsarāmi, devatte atha mānuse;","tha-ap503:20.3":"Aññaṃ gatiṃ na jānāmi, buddhapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap503:21.1":"“Duve kule pajāyāmi, khattiye cāpi brāhmaṇe;","tha-ap503:21.3":"Nīce kule na jāyāmi, buddhapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap503:22.1":"“Hatthiyānaṃ assayānaṃ, sivikaṃ sandamānikaṃ;","tha-ap503:22.3":"Labhāmi sabbamevetaṃ, buddhapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap503:23.1":"“Dāsīgaṇaṃ dāsagaṇaṃ, nāriyo samalaṅkatā;","tha-ap503:23.3":"Labhāmi sabbamevetaṃ, buddhapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap503:24.1":"“Koseyyakambaliyāni, khomakappāsikāni ca;","tha-ap503:24.3":"Labhāmi sabbamevetaṃ, buddhapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap503:25.1":"“Navavatthaṃ navaphalaṃ, navaggarasabhojanaṃ;","tha-ap503:25.3":"Labhāmi sabbamevetaṃ, buddhapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap503:26.1":"“Imaṃ khāda imaṃ bhuñja, imamhi sayane saya;","tha-ap503:26.3":"Labhāmi sabbamevetaṃ, buddhapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap503:27.1":"“Sabbattha pūjito homi, yaso abbhuggato mama;","tha-ap503:27.3":"Mahāpakkho sadā homi, abhejjapariso sadā;","tha-ap503:27.5":"Ñātīnaṃ uttamo homi, buddhapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap503:28.1":"“Sītaṃ uṇhaṃ na jānāmi, pariḷāho na vijjati;","tha-ap503:28.3":"Atho cetasikaṃ dukkhaṃ, hadaye me na vijjati.","tha-ap503:29.1":"“Suvaṇṇavaṇṇo hutvāna, saṃsarāmi bhavābhave;","tha-ap503:29.3":"Vevaṇṇiyaṃ na jānāmi, buddhapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap503:30.1":"“Devalokā cavitvāna, sukkamūlena codito;","tha-ap503:30.3":"Sāvatthiyaṃ pure jāto, mahāsāle suaḍḍhake.","tha-ap503:31.1":"“Pañca kāmaguṇe hitvā, pabbajiṃ anagāriyaṃ;","tha-ap503:31.3":"Jātiyā sattavassohaṃ, arahattamapāpuṇiṃ.","tha-ap503:32.1":"“Upasampādayī buddho, guṇamaññāya cakkhumā;","tha-ap503:32.3":"Taruṇo pūjanīyohaṃ, buddhapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap503:33.1":"“Dibbacakkhu visuddhaṃ me, samādhikusalo ahaṃ;","tha-ap503:33.3":"Abhiññāpāramippatto, buddhapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap503:34.1":"“Paṭisambhidā anuppatto, iddhipādesu kovido;","tha-ap503:34.3":"Dhammesu pāramippatto, buddhapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap503:35.1":"“Tiṃsakappasahassamhi, yaṃ buddhamabhipūjayiṃ;","tha-ap503:35.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, buddhapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap503:36.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ, bhavā sabbe samūhatā;","tha-ap503:36.3":"Nāgova bandhanaṃ chetvā, viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap503:37.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi, mama buddhassa santike;","tha-ap503:37.3":"Tisso vijjā anuppattā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap503:38.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso, vimokkhāpi ca aṭṭhime;","tha-ap503:38.3":"Chaḷabhiññā sacchikatā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap503:39.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā tikaṇikārapupphiyo thero imā Gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap503:40.1":"Tikaṇikārapupphiyattherassāpadānaṃ paṭhamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
